Product packaging
-----------------
The public product is MIT self-host. You run marketing (:43173) plus the
Langfuse OSS console (:3000: web, worker, Postgres, ClickHouse, Redis, MinIO).
There is no hosted Vết Cloud plan in this release (no Hobby / Core / Pro /
Enterprise SKU). Community support: https://github.com/Dondo0936/langben/issues
